[View: ProjectWorkItems]
route: /*/projects/*/issues/
memory:
  - Rows are anchors with id "issue-<uuid>" and href /:workspaceSlug/browse/:KEY/ — the KEY (e.g. ROCKET-5) is only in the href.
  - Inside a row the property dropdowns are the buttons with class "clickable", in column order - state, priority, assignee, dates. None has a label; click by position or open the row and edit in the peek panel.
  - Clicking a row title opens the work item; the row link href navigates to the full-page /browse/ view.

